# Editorial style

The site style is the cream editorial homepage in `home.css` and `index.html`. Read `STYLE.md` before changing layout, type, or colour.

- Paper `#f4efe7`, ink `#2a2521`, muted `#74695e`, green `#334f40`
- Cormorant Garamond for headings, Inter for body and UI
- Arch-cropped photos, tracked uppercase labels, ink pill buttons
- New pages use `body.home` and load `home.css` after `styles.css`
- Keep the copy. Do not invent a new layout, and do not restore the older Inter card homepage

`photography.html` is the only exception. Leave the camera viewfinder (`viewfinder.css`, `viewfinder.js`) as it is.
